#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to customize the configuration of a local Qiskit SDK installation."
msgstr ""
"Paano i-customize ang configuration ng lokal na Qiskit SDK na naka-install."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure the Qiskit SDK locally"
msgstr "I-configure ang Qiskit SDK nang lokal"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Configure the Qiskit SDK locally {#configure-the-qiskit-sdk-locally}"
msgstr ""
"I-configure ang Qiskit SDK nang lokal {#configure-the-qiskit-sdk-locally}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After the Qiskit SDK is installed and running, there are some optional steps"
" you can take to change the default Qiskit behavior.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pagkatapos ma-install at mapatakbo ang Qiskit SDK, may ilang opsyonal na "
"hakbang na maaari mong gawin para baguhin ang default na gawi ng Qiskit.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "User configuration file {#user-configuration-file}"
msgstr "User configuration file {#user-configuration-file}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The main location for local configuration of Qiskit is the user "
"configuration file. This is an .ini-format file that can be used to change "
"Qiskit default settings.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang pangunahing lokasyon para sa lokal na configuration ng Qiskit ay ang "
"user configuration file. Ito ay isang file na nasa .ini na format na "
"magagamit para baguhin ang mga default na setting ng Qiskit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Example:\n"
msgstr "Halimbawa:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"By default, this file is in `~/.qiskit/settings.conf` but the path can be "
"overridden with the `QISKIT_SETTINGS` environment variable.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa default, ang file na ito ay nasa `~/.qiskit/settings.conf` ngunit "
"maaaring palitan ang path gamit ang environment variable na "
"`QISKIT_SETTINGS`.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Available options {#available-options}"
msgstr "Mga available na opsyon {#available-options}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`circuit_drawer`: Changes the default system for the circuit drawer. It can "
"be set to `latex`, `mpl`, `text`, or `latex_source`. When the output kwarg "
"is not explicitly set, this drawer system is used.\n"
msgstr ""
"`circuit_drawer`: Binabago ang default na sistema para sa circuit drawer. "
"Maaaring itakda sa `latex`, `mpl`, `text`, o `latex_source`. Kapag hindi "
"tahasang nakatakda ang output kwarg, gagamitin ang drawer system na ito.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`circuit_mpl_style`: The default style sheet used for the mpl output system "
"for the circuit drawer. Valid values are `default` or `bw`.\n"
msgstr ""
"`circuit_mpl_style`: Ang default na style sheet na ginagamit para sa mpl "
"output system ng circuit drawer. Ang mga valid na value ay `default` o "
"`bw`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`circuit_mpl_style_path`: The paths to have the circuit drawer use to look "
"for JSON style sheets when using the mpl output mode.\n"
msgstr ""
"`circuit_mpl_style_path`: Ang mga path na gagamitin ng circuit drawer para "
"hanapin ang mga JSON style sheet kapag gumagamit ng mpl output mode.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`state_drawer`: This is used to change the default system for the state "
"visualization draw methods. Valid values are `repr`, `text`, `latex`, "
"`latex_source`, `qsphere`, `hinton`, or `bloch`. When the output kwarg is "
"not explicitly set on the "
"[qiskit.quantum_info.DensityMatrix.draw](../api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.DensityMatrix#densitymatrix)"
" method, the specified output method is used.\n"
msgstr ""
"`state_drawer`: Ginagamit ito para baguhin ang default na sistema para sa "
"mga draw method ng state visualization. Ang mga valid na value ay `repr`, "
"`text`, `latex`, `latex_source`, `qsphere`, `hinton`, o `bloch`. Kapag hindi"
" tahasang nakatakda ang output kwarg sa "
"[qiskit.quantum_info.DensityMatrix.draw](../api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.DensityMatrix#densitymatrix)"
" na method, gagamitin ang tinukoy na output method.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`transpile_optimization_level`: Change the default optimization level for "
"[qiskit.compiler.transpile](../api/qiskit/compiler#transpile). Specify an "
"integer 0-3.\n"
msgstr ""
"`transpile_optimization_level`: Binabago ang default na optimization level "
"para sa [qiskit.compiler.transpile](../api/qiskit/compiler#transpile). "
"Magtukoy ng integer na 0-3.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`parallel`: Whether Python multiprocessing is enabled for operations that "
"support running in parallel.  For example, transpilation of multiple "
"[qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit](../api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#quantumcircuit-"
"class) objects. This setting can be overridden by the `QISKIT_PARALLEL` "
"environment variable. Specify a boolean value.\n"
msgstr ""
"`parallel`: Kung naka-enable ang Python multiprocessing para sa mga "
"operasyong sumusuporta sa parallel na pagpapatakbo. Halimbawa, ang "
"transpilation ng maraming "
"[qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit](../api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#quantumcircuit-"
"class) na object. Maaaring i-override ang setting na ito gamit ang "
"environment variable na `QISKIT_PARALLEL`. Magtukoy ng boolean na value.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`num_processes`: The maximum number of parallel processes to launch for "
"parallel operations if parallel execution is enabled. This setting can be "
"overridden by the `QISKIT_NUM_PROCS` environment variable. Specify an "
"integer greater than `0`. \n"
msgstr ""
"`num_processes`: Ang pinakamataas na bilang ng parallel na proseso na "
"ilulunsad para sa mga parallel na operasyon kung naka-enable ang parallel "
"execution. Maaaring i-override ang setting na ito gamit ang environment "
"variable na `QISKIT_NUM_PROCS`. Magtukoy ng integer na mas malaki sa `0`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`min_qpy_version`: QPY loading will reject files with a QPY version lower "
"than the one defined here. This option can be used to restrict allowed QPY "
"versions when deserialization security issues are discovered in older QPY "
"versions, preventing the loading of potentially malicious payloads.\n"
msgstr ""
"`min_qpy_version`: Tatanggihan ng pag-load ng QPY ang mga file na may QPY "
"version na mas mababa kaysa sa tinukoy dito. Maaaring gamitin ang opsyong "
"ito para limitahan ang mga pinahintulutang bersyon ng QPY kapag may "
"natuklasang mga isyu sa seguridad ng deserialization sa mga mas lumang "
"bersyon ng QPY, na pinipigilan ang pag-load ng mga potensyal na mapanganib "
"na payload.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"* Circuit drawer settings apply to [qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit.draw](../api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit) and [qiskit.visualization.circuit_drawer](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.visualization.circuit_drawer#qiskitvisualizationcircuit_drawer).\n"
"* State visualization draw methods are [qiskit.quantum_info.Statevector.draw](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Statevector#statevector) and [qiskit.quantum_info.DensityMatrix.draw](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Statevector#statevector).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"* Ang mga setting ng circuit drawer ay nalalapat sa [qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit.draw](../api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit) at [qiskit.visualization.circuit_drawer](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.visualization.circuit_drawer#qiskitvisualizationcircuit_drawer).\n"
"* Ang mga draw method ng state visualization ay [qiskit.quantum_info.Statevector.draw](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Statevector#statevector) at [qiskit.quantum_info.DensityMatrix.draw](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Statevector#statevector).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Environment variables {#environment-variables}"
msgstr "Environment variables {#environment-variables}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set these environment variables to alter the default behavior of Qiskit:\n"
msgstr ""
"Itakda ang mga environment variable na ito para baguhin ang default na gawi "
"ng Qiskit:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`QISKIT_PARALLEL`: Enables Python multiprocessing to parallelize certain "
"operations; for example, transpilation over multiple circuits in Qiskit. "
"Specify a boolean value.\n"
msgstr ""
"`QISKIT_PARALLEL`: Ino-enable ang Python multiprocessing para i-parallelize "
"ang ilang operasyon; halimbawa, transpilation sa maraming circuit sa Qiskit."
" Magtukoy ng boolean na value.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`QISKIT_NUM_PROCS`: The maximum number of parallel processes to launch for "
"parallel operations if parallel execution is enabled. Specify an integer "
"greater than zero.\n"
msgstr ""
"`QISKIT_NUM_PROCS`: Ang pinakamataas na bilang ng parallel na proseso na "
"ilulunsad para sa mga parallel na operasyon kung naka-enable ang parallel "
"execution. Magtukoy ng integer na mas malaki sa zero.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`RAYON_NUM_THREADS`: The number of threads to run multithreaded operations "
"in Qiskit. By default, multithreaded code launches a thread for each logical"
" CPU. To adjust the number of threads Qiskit uses, set this to an integer "
"value. For example, setting RAYON_NUM_THREADS=4 launches four threads for "
"multithreaded functions. \n"
msgstr ""
"`RAYON_NUM_THREADS`: Ang bilang ng thread para patakbuhin ang mga "
"multithreaded na operasyon sa Qiskit. Sa default, naglulunsad ang "
"multithreaded na code ng isang thread para sa bawat logical CPU. Para ayusin"
" ang bilang ng thread na ginagamit ng Qiskit, itakda ito sa isang integer na"
" value. Halimbawa, ang pagtatakda ng RAYON_NUM_THREADS=4 ay naglulunsad ng "
"apat na thread para sa mga multithreaded na function.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`QISKIT_FORCE_THREADS`: Specifies that multithreaded code should always "
"execute in multiple threads. By default, if you're running multithreaded "
"code in a section of Qiskit that is already running in parallel processes, "
"Qiskit does not launch multiple threads but instead executes that function "
"serially. This is done to avoid potentially overloading limited CPU "
"resources. However, if you want to force the use of multiple threads even "
"when in a multiprocess context, set `QISKIT_FORCE_THREADS=TRUE`.\n"
msgstr ""
"`QISKIT_FORCE_THREADS`: Tinutukoy na ang multithreaded na code ay dapat "
"palaging tumakbo (isagawa) sa maraming thread. Sa default, kung nagpapatakbo"
" ka ng multithreaded na code sa isang seksyon ng Qiskit na nasa parallel na "
"proseso na, hindi naglulunsad ang Qiskit ng maraming thread kundi "
"isinasagawa ang function na iyon nang sunud-sunod. Ginagawa ito para "
"maiwasan ang potensyal na pag-overload ng limitadong CPU resources. "
"Gayunpaman, kung gusto mong pilitin ang paggamit ng maraming thread kahit "
"nasa multiprocess na konteksto, itakda ang `QISKIT_FORCE_THREADS=TRUE`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`QISKIT_SABRE_ALL_THREADS`: Controls the behavior of the layout and routing "
"pass in Qiskit's preset pass manager. When set to `1` or `TRUE`, this uses "
"all available CPUs for running multiple random trials. This can improve the "
"quality of the results, especially for systems with greater than 20 "
"CPUs/cores; the tradeoff, however, is that results are not reproducible when"
" run on different local hardware.\n"
msgstr ""
"`QISKIT_SABRE_ALL_THREADS`: Kinokontrol ang gawi ng layout at routing pass "
"sa preset pass manager ng Qiskit. Kapag nakatakda sa `1` o `TRUE`, ginagamit"
" nito ang lahat ng available na CPU para sa pagpapatakbo ng maraming random "
"na trial. Maaari nitong mapabuti ang kalidad ng mga resulta, lalo na para sa"
" mga sistema na may higit sa 20 CPU/core; gayunpaman, ang kapalit ay hindi "
"na maaaring i-reproduce ang mga resulta kapag pinatakbo sa ibang lokal na "
"hardware.\n"

